# Whitelist approach: ignore everything, then un-ignore config worth versioning.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!statusline.sh
!skills/
!skills/**
!hooks/
!hooks/**

# Explicitly NOT tracked (runtime data, caches, secrets, transcripts):
#   projects/ history.jsonl sessions/ telemetry/ statsig/ file-history/
#   paste-cache/ shell-snapshots/ session-env/ todos/ tasks/ backups/
#   cache/ debug/ chrome/ plugins/ stats-cache.json mcp-needs-auth-cache.json
#   settings.local.json (local machine overrides, intentionally untracked)
